ug report or a\r\nfeature request, ensure that your submission is for an\r\n[OS that we support](https://www.elastic.co/support/matrix#show_os).\r\nBug reports on an OS that we do not support or feature requests\r\nspecific to an OS that we do not support will be closed.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nIf you are filing a bug report, please remove the below feature\r\nrequest block and provide responses for all of the below items.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n**Elasticsearch version**: 5.1.2\r\n\r\n**Plugins installed**: []\r\n\r\n**JVM version**: 1.8.0_92\r\n\r\n**OS version**: OS X Yosemite 10.10.5\r\n\r\n**Description of the problem including expected versus actual behavior**:\r\n\r\nWhen performing a `function_score` query with `boost_mode` set to `replace`, the query is supposed to ignore the scores of the query component of the `function_score` query and only use the scores given by the functions.  Instead, for some queries, Elasticsearch is (incorrectly) giving scores of zero.\r\n\r\n**Steps to reproduce**:\r\n 1. Execute the following curl commands:\r\n\r\n```\r\ncurl -XPOST \"http://localhost:9200/test/test\" -d'\r\n{\r\n  \"description\": \"banana\",\r\n  \"date\": \"2016-01-01\"\r\n}'\r\n\r\ncurl -XGET \"http://localhost:9200/test/test/_search\" -d'\r\n{\r\n  \"query\": {\r\n    \"function_score\": {\r\n      \"boost_mode\": \"replace\",\r\n      \"score_mode\": \"max\",\r\n      \"query\": {\r\n        \"bool\": {\r\n          \"filter\": [\r\n            {\r\n              \"range\": {\r\n                \"date\": {\r\n                  \"gte\": \"2016-01-01\"\r\n                }\r\n              }\r\n            }\r\n          ]\r\n        }\r\n      },\r\n      \"functions\": [\r\n        {\r\n          \"weight\": 3,\r\n          \"filter\": {\r\n            \"match\": {\r\n              \"description\": \"banana\"\r\n            }\r\n          }\r\n        }\r\n      ]\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n}'\r\n```\r\n\r\n 2. Note how the score is 0 when it should be 3.\r\n\r\n```\r\n{\r\n  \"took\": 2,\r\n  \"timed_out\": false,\r\n  \"_shards\": {\r\n    \"total\": 5,\r\n    \"successful\": 5,\r\n    \"failed\": 0\r\n  },\r\n  \"hits\": {\r\n    \"total\": 1,\r\n    \"max_score\": 0,\r\n    \"hits\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"_index\": \"test\",\r\n        \"_type\": \"test\",\r\n        \"_id\": \"AVmhFx-cux_TRkqjzbdy\",\r\n        \"_score\": 0,\r\n        \"_source\": {\r\n          \"description\": \"banana\",\r\n          \"date\": \"2016-01-01\"\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    ]\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Provide logs (if relevant)**:\r\nN/A\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/22629/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/22629/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]